  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After the damaged Battle Bone Wheel enters his aperture, Fang Yuan ties that Gu to Shen Jie Ao, the rank eight Demonic Gu Immortal also known as Proud Bone Demon Lord. When Shen Jie Ao became a rank six Gu Immortal and lacked a rank six Gu, he created the killer move White Bone Chariot. It consisted of many rank five Gu such as the white bone wheel, and had power comparable to a rank six Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        431
      ],
